## SQ-CCO-08 | Create Gravity per-entity logic runs in the End only (gravityLimitDimensions = true)
@reviewed 2026-11-26
@group -
@commands Create Gravity: `grep -iE "gravity" logs/latest.log \| head -5`; falling block or item entity in the overworld vs the End (`/execute in minecraft:the_end run summon minecraft:falling_block ~ 120 ~ {BlockState:{Name:"minecraft:sand"}}`)
@pass no mixin error; the overworld entity is not ticked by Gravity's per-entity logic, the End entity is (`[perf] gravityLimitDimensions = true`); with `qrun.py toml srv/config/creativecommon-common.toml perf gravityLimitDimensions false` and a reboot both dimensions are ticked
@fails `CreateGravityDimensionMixin`, config key
@from batches/r1107cco/b2_console.qb
# Gravity adds its low-gravity modifier only while the entity falls (removed on landing): read it mid-fall from y 200.
# NoAI mobs do not move at all in 1.19, so these zombies have AI
# judge-c r1123cc: Invulnerable on both, the overworld zombie died of fall damage before its Pos read ("No entity was found")
bootreject (?i)CreateGravityDimensionMixin.*(error|fail)
shell s=$(ls */serverconfig/create_gravity-server.toml | head -1); grep -E "biome_configs" $s
# the set boots peaceful (spawn-monsters=false): peaceful removes the zombies at once
> difficulty normal
> kill @e[tag=cco08]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add 0 0
> execute in minecraft:the_end run summon minecraft:zombie 0 200 0 {Silent:1b,Invulnerable:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cco08","cco08e"]}
> execute in minecraft:overworld run summon minecraft:zombie 3 200 3 {Silent:1b,Invulnerable:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cco08","cco08o"]}
sleep 2
> execute in minecraft:the_end run data get entity @e[tag=cco08e,limit=1] Pos[1]
> data get entity @e[tag=cco08o,limit=1] Pos[1]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run data get entity @e[tag=cco08e,limit=1] Attributes
> data get entity @e[tag=cco08o,limit=1] Attributes
look End zombie is higher after the same time (slower fall) and carries the Low Gravity Biome modifier on forge:entity_gravity ([I;2020721635,269896998,-1235373740,-1522950634]); the overworld zombie falls at vanilla speed with no modifier
> kill @e[tag=cco08]
> difficulty peaceful

